                    ResNet18 on the lesion images, mapping                      
                    benign and non-neoplastic to class 0                        
                    and malignant to class 1. To promote                        
                    fairness across skin tones, we sample                       
                    each batch uniformly across skin_tone                       
                    groups via a weighted sampler. We                           
