                    model's fairness across skin tones                          
                    without sacrificing overall accuracy.                       
                    The model was saved correctly as                            
                    'model.pth' and a prediction function                       
                    is provided for inference on new                            
                    images.                                                     
                    Validation Metric: 0.8915                                   
                                                                                
