                    successfully, producing a mean                              
                    cross-validation AUROC of 0.8915,                           
                    indicating strong model performance in                      
                    classifying malignant vs benign                             
                    lesions. The fairness gap in AUROC                          
                    between light and dark skin tones is                        
                    minimal at 0.0301, demonstrating the                        
                    model's fairness across skin tones                          
                    without sacrificing overall accuracy.                       
                    The model was saved correctly as                            
                    'model.pth' and a prediction function                       
                    is provided for inference on new                            
